<h2>Segment 203 &mdash; meaningless speech and fruit</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s203S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w1">tshig kyal ba</span>&#x27;i ni, &#x27;bras bu&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w2">ljon shing</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w3">&#x27;bras bu</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w4">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w5">&#x27;chags pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w6">dus min</span> par yang &#x27;bras bu <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w7">&#x27;chags pa</span> dang dus su <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w8">mi</span> &#x27;chags pa dang <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w9">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w10">smin pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w11">smin par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w12">snang ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w13">rtsa ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w14">mi brtan pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w15">ring du</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w16">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w17">gnas pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w18">kun dga&#x27; ra ba</span>&#x27;am <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w19">nags tshal</span> lam <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w20">rdzing bu</span> nyams dga&#x27; ba mi mang ba dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w21">&#x27;jigs pa</span>&#x27;i rgyu <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w22">mang po</span> dang ldan pa dang</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s203S">Because you have <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w1">talked meaninglessly</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w3">fruits</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w4">refuse</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w5">grow</span> on the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w2">trees</span>, or they start to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w7">grow</span> at the <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w6">wrong times</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w8">never</span> at the right times, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w12">seem</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w11">ripe</span> when they&#x27;re still <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w9">not</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w10">ripe</span>, or their <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w13">roots</span> are <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w14">frail</span>, or they ca<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w16">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w17">stay</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w15">long</span>; there are no places to take your leisure, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w18">parks</span>, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w19">glades</span>, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w20">pools of cool water</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w22">many</span> things around to make you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w21">afraid</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment by Codex (Tibetan-first independent proposal). Original GMR English and ACIP-derived Wylie preserved. The first attributive 'bras bu'i and later resumed 'bras bu are omitted as redistributed content; the second 'bras bu owns fruits. The first two 'chags pa own the two grow occurrences; the third is elided after never. mi owns refuse, then never, then the negative n't of can't; the mi inside mi brtan pa belongs to the complete privative phrase frail. The two ripe occurrences cross Tibetan order: smin pa owns the final ripe, smin par the first. dus min is the contrastive wrong times phrase; dus su/right times and par, yang are omitted because their material is distributed in the temporal recast. nyams dga' ba mi mang ba is omitted: leisure wording and repeated no do not support independent atoms, and not-many cannot automatically be identified with absolute absence. rgyu and ldan pa are omitted as distributed across things, make and there are. No uncertain correspondence is nulled. This is a proposal, not human-approved correspondence.</div>
